            "body": "<p>本站照片按 Creative Commons 许可使用，经裁切与调色：</p><p>Baobab fruit — Ton Rulkens, <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Baobab_-_fruit_(8750413322).jpg\">Wikimedia Commons</a>, CC BY-SA 2.0 · Dried baobab pulp — Kadjia18, <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Pain_de_singe_bouyy.jpg\">Wikimedia Commons</a>, CC BY-SA 4.0 · Imbondeiro tree — Alfred Weidinger, <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Imbondeiro_Tree.jpg\">Wikimedia Commons</a>, CC BY 2.0 · Imbondeiro in the cacimbo mist — L. Willms, <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Imbondeiro_en-nevoa-do-kacimbo_LWS906.JPG\">Wikimedia Commons</a>, CC BY-SA 3.0 · Múcua on the branch — L. Willms, <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Fruta-de-Imbondeiro-Angola_LWS724.JPG\">Wikimedia Commons</a>, CC BY 3.0 · Waku-Kungo valley — Rogério Melo, <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Waku_Kungo_-_panoramio_-_Rog%C3%A9rio_Melo_(4).jpg\">Wikimedia Commons</a>, CC BY 3.0. Photographs of Fazenda 27's plant: Fruttita. Map of Angola drawn by Fruttita from <a href=\"https://www.geoboundaries.org\">geoBoundaries</a> province data (CC BY 4.0) and <a href=\"https://www.naturalearthdata.com\">Natural Earth</a> (public domain).</p>",
